                <pb facs="d444-02" n="2" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76ve01/d444-02"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume E–1, Documents on Global Issues,
                    1969–1972. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Documents 248, 249, and 250. (Date of correction:
                            January 18, 2017)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>After publication, it was discovered that the text for Document 248 was
                        missing and that the above documents were published in the wrong order.
                        Editors added the text for Document 248 and revised the document numbers,
                        correcting Document 248 to Document 249, Document 249 to Document 250, and
                        Document 250 to Document 248.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
